OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFamily of prison officer killed by IRA
OL,4,Ato get state apology
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were three separate garda (Irish
OL,7,Fpolice) investigations into Stack's
OL,8,Fdeath, but no-one was brought to
OL,9,Fjustice for his killing. On Wednesday,
OL,10,FTaoiseach Micheal Martin will offer an
OL,11,Fapology on behalf of the state during a
OL,12,Fsitting of the Dail (Irish parliament).
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
